1
00:00:00,548 --> 00:00:08,863
GlattTrack. Kashrut tracking in the slaughterhouse, from slaughter to the stamp. Every animal gets one number, and every station sees it.

2
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:18,744
In the settings: kashrut statuses. Every plant has its own kashrut: Glatt, Beit Yosef, MK, kosher, or any other name.

3
00:00:20,952 --> 00:00:25,488
Add a status: a name, and a group. Chalak, or not chalak.

4
00:00:28,682 --> 00:00:35,023
A name for the stickers, in Hebrew and in English, is optional. And a colour, from a large palette.

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,586
The slaughter tablet. The shochet presses one button per animal, and the next number fills in by itself.

6
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:05,305
Animal eight: not chalak. At the outer ruling it gets only a not chalak status, or treif.

7
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:18,430
The legs and head tablet. Stickers are printed right after slaughter, before the ruling. It can also be split: one tablet for legs, one for the head.

8
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:21,581
The first tap prints the leg stickers.

9
00:01:24,245 --> 00:01:31,609
The legs sticker. Printed: the number, the Hebrew and Gregorian dates, and the time. In the QR code: everything.

10
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:37,154
The inner inspector's tablet. Tap the next animal in line.

11
00:01:39,049 --> 00:01:42,049
Rumen check: kosher.

12
00:01:43,227 --> 00:01:46,227
Maw: kosher.

13
00:01:47,368 --> 00:01:50,373
The lung drawing: mark it with a finger.

14
00:01:55,191 --> 00:01:59,895
Approve for the outer inspector. The animal moves on with its drawing.

15
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:18,746
The outer inspector's tablet. The lung drawing is shown, and the inspector rules.

16
00:02:22,112 --> 00:02:25,112
Animal one: MK.

17
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:33,179
Animal eight, not chalak: only the plant's not chalak statuses appear, and treif.

18
00:02:35,638 --> 00:02:38,200
Ruled: Magen David.

19
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:44,232
Animal one: both cheeks print. The tongue is held, so it does not print.

20
00:02:47,830 --> 00:02:53,059
The parts sticker: the ruling in Hebrew and English, and the MK kashrut mark.

21
00:02:54,280 --> 00:03:02,189
The summaries: every kashrut status, treif by kind, maw, rumen and lungs, and nevela and shot, each on its own.

22
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,368
Sample stickers, every kind.

23
00:03:06,368 --> 00:03:15,769
Top row: legs and head, before the ruling. Bottom row: parts and stamps, with the name in Hebrew and English on one line, and the plant's kashrut marks.

24
00:03:17,171 --> 00:03:22,025
GlattTrack. Every animal, every kashrut mark, in one place.
